WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.697
Category standardization is more than text cleaning
If several labels

00:00:05.723 --> 00:00:11.817
should map to one canonical category that mapping
reflects business meaning You

00:00:11.830 --> 00:00:17.393
need a documented rule Do not merge categories
simply because their

00:00:17.406 --> 00:00:23.568
names look similar The transformation should reflect
the intended taxonomy
